              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "थकान (thakān) — \"tiredness\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आज बहुत थकान (thakān) है — \"I am very tired today\", literally \"today there is a lot of tiredness\". The बहुत and आज are both yours already."
            }
